[EXAMPLES]
Delete the record at position 2:

  recdel -n 2 contacts.rec

Delete all records matching an expression:

  recdel -e "Status = 'closed'" -t Task todo.rec

Comment out records instead of deleting them:

  recdel -c -e "Status = 'archived'" todo.rec

